{"id":"78bf2ec267a1c34b","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-self-reference.md","title":"自指","display":"df-self-reference — 自指","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-self-reference","aliases":["91-df-self-reference","91-df-self-referential"],"display":"df-self-reference — 自指","depends_on":["[[91-df-ground-language]]","[[91-df-numeral]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-self-reference"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-self-reference</span><span>91-df-self-referential</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-self-reference — 自指"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2ad7561edabb2148\" href=\"?note=2ad7561edabb2148\" title=\"91-df-ground-language\">91-df-ground-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"822ef14bbd4e020d\" href=\"?note=822ef14bbd4e020d\" title=\"91-df-numeral\">91-df-numeral</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{L}_T\">\\(\\mathcal{L}_T\\)</span> (扩展语言)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (可表示句法运算的算术理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_T}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\)</span> (至多含指定数变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 自由的公式集)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}self\\text{-}reference}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SelfRef}_S(\\psi,\\varphi)\\coloneqq\n\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n\\land S\\vdash\n\\bigl(\\psi\\leftrightarrow\n\\varphi(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner})\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}self\\text{-}reference}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SelfRef}_S(\\psi,\\varphi)\\coloneqq\n\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n\\land S\\vdash\n\\bigl(\\psi\\leftrightarrow\n\\varphi(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner})\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对角线引理进一步保证：对每个合适的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(x)\">\\(\\varphi(x)\\)</span>，存在满足此关系的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\">\\(\\psi\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\">\\(\\psi\\)</span> : 自指句子</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner \\psi \\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner \\psi \\urcorner\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\">\\(\\psi\\)</span>的Gödel编码</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(\\ulcorner \\psi \\urcorner)\">\\(\\varphi(\\ulcorner \\psi \\urcorner)\\)</span> : 关于<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\">\\(\\psi\\)</span>自身的断言</li>\n</ul>\n<p>说明：自指是句子以某种方式指向自身的现象。在形式系统中，自指通过对角线引理构造，是形式系统的固有特征。</p>\n<p>自指的类型：</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>构造方式</th>\n<th>例子</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>对角固定点</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\vdash\\psi\\leftrightarrow\\varphi(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner})\">\\(S\\vdash\\psi\\leftrightarrow\\varphi(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner})\\)</span></td>\n<td>Gödel句子</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>真理自指</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi \\leftrightarrow T(\\ulcorner \\psi \\urcorner)\">\\(\\psi \\leftrightarrow T(\\ulcorner \\psi \\urcorner)\\)</span></td>\n<td>真理陈述者</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>否定自指</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi \\leftrightarrow \\neg T(\\ulcorner \\psi \\urcorner)\">\\(\\psi \\leftrightarrow \\neg T(\\ulcorner \\psi \\urcorner)\\)</span></td>\n<td>说谎者</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>自指与悖论：\n自指本身不导致悖论；特定的反调真理方程会产生说谎者现象，但\n“含否定的自指”并不是一个单独的充分条件：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>说谎者：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda \\leftrightarrow \\neg T(\\ulcorner \\lambda \\urcorner)\">\\(\\lambda \\leftrightarrow \\neg T(\\ulcorner \\lambda \\urcorner)\\)</span>（悖论）</li>\n<li>真理陈述者：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau \\leftrightarrow T(\\ulcorner \\tau \\urcorner)\">\\(\\tau \\leftrightarrow T(\\ulcorner \\tau \\urcorner)\\)</span>（非悖论，两解）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>自指的普遍性：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>对角线引理保证自指句子存在</li>\n<li>固定点的可证等价相对于背景理论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>；其存在要求足够的句法可表示能力</li>\n<li>自指是足够强的形式系统的必然现象</li>\n</ul>\n<p>真理理论的处理：</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>理论</th>\n<th>对自指的处理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>类型化理论</td>\n<td>禁止<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>谓词自指（分层）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>KF</td>\n<td>允许自指，以强 Kleene 固定点为意向语义，但对象演绎逻辑经典</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FS</td>\n<td>允许自指，并以受控捕获/释放规则处理真理迭代</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>定义的意义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>理解自指的本质</li>\n<li>区分不同类型的自指</li>\n<li>为悖论分析提供基础</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-ground-language","status":"resolved","id":"2ad7561edabb2148","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-ground-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"822ef14bbd4e020d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-numeral]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal{L}_T","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_T}","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}self\\text{-}reference}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SelfRef}_S(\\psi,\\varphi)\\coloneqq\n\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n\\land S\\vdash\n\\bigl(\\psi\\leftrightarrow\n\\varphi(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner})\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\varphi(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"\\ulcorner \\psi \\urcorner","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi(\\ulcorner \\psi \\urcorner)","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"S\\vdash\\psi\\leftrightarrow\\varphi(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner})","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi \\leftrightarrow T(\\ulcorner \\psi \\urcorner)","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi \\leftrightarrow \\neg T(\\ulcorner \\psi \\urcorner)","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda \\leftrightarrow \\neg T(\\ulcorner \\lambda \\urcorner)","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau \\leftrightarrow T(\\ulcorner \\tau \\urcorner)","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false}],"bytes":2594,"backlinks":[{"id":"cac035693aea2791","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"724d38bcb2abeb43","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"967c10482b90bea3","anchor":"ref-47","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-self-reference]]"},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-58","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-self-reference]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-75","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-